For your projects, a useful convention could be:

resolvehub/backend:1.0.0
resolvehub/agent:1.0.0
resolvehub/frontend:1.0.0

or with a registry:

registry.example.com/resolvehub/backend:1.0.0

Microservices:

resolvehub/auth-service:1.0.0
resolvehub/incident-service:1.0.0
resolvehub/notification-service:1.0.0

The exact naming scheme depends on your organization.